{"id":"1bc3aa8e-eea5-4e17-8d81-f47e271c1d5a","title":"Decypher 7","slug":"decypher-7","collectionSlug":"decypher","collectionName":"Decypher","category":"logo","categoryZh":"文字特效","description":"A stylized WiFi symbol composed of three stacked curved segments arranged vertically against a pure black background. Each segment features a distinctive glass-like material with a 3D extruded appearance, creating depth and dimensionality. The segments display a complex layered effect combining multiple shader techniques: a satin fabric texture with deep purple and dark magenta tones creates the base coloration, while a kaleidoscopic pattern with 4-segment symmetry adds intricate geometric detail within each curved shape. Grid distortion creates a warped, rippling effect across the surfaces, and pixelation with a scale of 50 adds a digital, blocky aesthetic with visible pixel gaps. A chalkboard effect with magenta chalk color (#c71585) overlaid in linear dodge blend mode creates bright pink accents and edge highlights. The glass component has a fresnel effect with a deep purple fringe color (#5a1a3a), refraction value of 0.37, and a bevel of 0.02, giving the segments a glossy, translucent quality. A CRT screen effect with scanlines, color shift, and vignetting adds a retro digital monitor aesthetic with visible horizontal scan lines and subtle color separation. The overall mood is cyberpunk and digital, with a blend of organic glass-like qualities and harsh pixelated, glitchy digital artifacts. The lighting appears to come from a 300-degree angle, creating subtle highlights and depth perception across the curved surfaces.","colors":["#000000","#2a0038","#5a1a3a","#c71585"],"labels":["3d","geometric","retro","dark"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/1bc3aa8e-eea5-4e17-8d81-f47e271c1d5a.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"SolidColor","id":"idmv4n7yq56wwrg2use","_key":"key_1791772729997_0.703230077082715","props":{"color":"#000000","opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","blendMode"